<title>USA: Ringer names Stanley Goldberg chairman.</title>
<headline>Ringer names Stanley Goldberg chairman.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ringer Corp said Wednesday it named Stanley Goldberg as chairman of its board of directors, replacing Gordon Stofer who will remain as a director.</p>
<p>Goldberg will serve as chairman in addition to his current position as president and chief executive, Ringer said. He joined the company in 1992 and has been chief executive since 1993.</p>
<p>Ringer provides lawn and garden care products.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
